  "translations": [
    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "你总缠着的那条头巾，年头可够久了。换条新的怎么样？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 75,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "不，不用了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 18,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "可我们的Boss老是缠着一条破破烂烂的头巾，这也……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 70,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "不，这是别人送给我的。不能扔。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 45,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "啊，那就另说了……说起来，听说格瓦拉也很珍惜一条黑色围巾。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 87,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "裙子？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 9,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE;WORDPLAY_PRESERVED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "……不，是围巾。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 24,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE;WORDPLAY_PRESERVED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "哦。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 6,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "听说他在战斗中摔断手臂时，从战友那里得到了一条围巾。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 78,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "格瓦拉就用那条丝巾吊住手臂……而送他丝巾的人，后来成了他的第二任妻子。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 105,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "好像叫阿莱达吧。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 24,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 11,
      "cn_text": "即使手臂痊愈后，听说格瓦拉也一直把那条围巾带在身边。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 78,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 12,
      "cn_text": "你那条头巾，也是心上人送的吗？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 45,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 13,
      "cn_text": "不是你想的那样……不过，它对我很重要。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 57,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE"
    }
